@PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7280
#
# Auth por cookies httpOnly → tem de ser HTTPS (7280). Sobre HTTP (5280) os cookies "Secure"
# não são guardados/enviados. O cliente .http mantém os cookies entre pedidos, por isso o fluxo é:
# 1) Login (define os cookies) → 2..) os pedidos seguintes vão autenticados pelo cookie access_token.
# As mutações (criar delivery, logout) exigem o header X-CSRF-TOKEN (anti-forgery) — ver passo 3.

### 1. Login (JSON) → 204 No Content + Set-Cookie (access_token, refresh_token)
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "Password1!"
}

### 2. Perfil do utilizador autenticado (usa o cookie access_token) → 200
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/account
Accept: application/json

### 3. Obter o token anti-forgery (guarda o cookie __Host-csrf + devolve o request-token) → 200
# @name antiforgery
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/antiforgery/token
Accept: application/json

### 4. Criar uma delivery (autenticado pelo cookie + X-CSRF-TOKEN) → 200
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deliveries
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery.response.body.$.token}}

{
  "details": {
    "clientReference": "REF-001",
    "numberOfVolumes": 2,
    "totalWeightOfVolumes": 4.5,
    "amount": null,
    "instructions": "Leave at the front desk",
    "preferentialPeriod": "09:00-13:00"
  },
  "sender": {
    "name": "Acme Warehouse",
    "contact": { "name": "John Sender", "phoneNumber": "912345678", "email": "sender@example.com" },
    "address": { "addressLine": "Rua A, 1", "place": "Lisboa", "zipCode": "1000-001", "zipCodePlace": "Lisboa", "countryCode": "PT" }
  },
  "receiver": {
    "name": "Jane Receiver",
    "contact": { "name": "Jane Receiver", "phoneNumber": "913333444", "email": "receiver@example.com" },
    "address": { "addressLine": "Rua B, 2", "place": "Porto", "zipCode": "4000-002", "zipCodePlace": "Porto", "countryCode": "PT" }
  },
  "attributes": { "pod": true, "sameDay": false, "cashOnDelivery": false }
}

### 5. As minhas deliveries (paginado, autenticado pelo cookie) → 200
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/deliveries?page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### 6. Refresh (o cookie refresh_token vai sozinho — Path=/api/authentication) → 204 + cookies novos
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/refresh

### 7. Logout (autenticado pelo cookie + X-CSRF-TOKEN) → 204 (remove o refresh da BD + apaga os cookies)
POST {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/logout
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{antiforgery.response.body.$.token}}

### 8. Perfil DEPOIS do logout (sem cookie válido) → 401
GET {{PackageDelivery.Api_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/account
Accept: application/json

###
